UID:a1eoogmbenq2vfg6vdr8dr88ts@google.com
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Afternoon session run by [public facilitator omitted]\n$10 or $15 for Morning and Afternoon sessions\n\nCome and join us to explore a strange new land and unlock its wonderous secrets! This game is intended to be a more serious and grounded campaign set in a homebrew world that has just discovered a new continent. Expect difficult decisions\, challenging battles\, draining exploration\, and above all a good time! \n\nThis campaign is Experience based\, and new players will start at three quarters of the party total. Reach out to the DM in person or at [public contact omitted] if you have any questions about joining!
LOCATION:The Vault at VGA
SEQUENCE:6
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Afternoon D&D Session $10 Entry
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
