DESCRIPTION:Prepare to slay the grey! Come in and join other hobbyists while we all spend some time working on our various piles of shame. \n\nAll free participants in this free event will receive a demo model and access to our store paints\, tools\, and airbrushes.\n\nA rotating cast of instructors will be by to teach classes on specific techniques and styles\, keep your eye out such special events.
