UID:7c4jt2umd0ceimd1cifg82hvfr@google.com
DESCRIPTION:<b>Warhammer 40k Demo - Learn to play!</b><br>Come and learn how to play Warhammer 40k taught using the Combat Patrol game mode. Bring your own force or borrow one of our 20 demo patrols from a variety of different factions! No experience necessary\, first time players will also receive a <i>free miniature! </i><b></b><br><b><br></b><br><b>Casual Play:</b><br>Free and open tables prepared for Warhammer 40k narrative and casual! We will have thematic\, asymmetrical\, and/or unique terrain and mission setups to play some laid back yet enjoyable games.  <br>Players of all skill levels are welcome!  <br>2000pt loaner armies and models are available upon request.
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Warhammer 40k Casual Play and Demos
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
